/// Tests for [AgentPackResolver] (dm.ai #579): pack detection, zip-slip
/// rejection, manifest verification, entry override, cache hit, and the
/// agents/→pack-root path duality. Java parity: `AgentPackResolverTest`.
void main() {
  setUp(() {
